# Build context for backend/Dockerfile is the repository root (it bakes in data, models and the vector index).
# Allowlist: everything else stays out of the image and the build context.
*
!backend/requirements.lock
!backend/alembic.ini
!backend/migrations/
!backend/app/
!data/raw/vehicles.json
!data/documents/
!models/
!vectorstore/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
